{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>זכרון בספר ושים באזני</b> — notarikon: זבוב, שרץ — after the blood of Israel like a fly." "<b>מחה אמחה</b> — in gematria: זה המן. אמחה — twice in the Masorah: here, and the other at the Flood. Just as there (Genesis 7:23), 'all that is on the earth was wiped out,' so too Amalek must be wiped out so that no remnant remains for him at all. Therefore Saul was punished, for he left him a remnant."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:13:27.806761245Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}